{"municipality_code":"10344","pref":"群馬県","city":"榛東村","headline":"貴重な土木遺産があります。","display_comment_enriched":"榛東村には、広馬場村、新井村、山子田村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「茅野遺跡」、「高塚古墳」、「柳沢寺」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、広馬場村や新井村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 「ガラメキ温泉」や「しんとう温泉」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":17,"rank":1219,"percentile":35.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":5,"rank":1086,"percentile":40.2,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":31,"rank":826,"percentile":55.1,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":8,"rank":1011,"percentile":40.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":2,"rank":1181,"percentile":27.7,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":4,"rank":1422,"percentile":22.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["ガラメキ温泉","しんとう温泉","聖宮神社","黒髪山神社","宿稲荷神社","八幡宮","柳沢寺","常将神社"],"food_culture